"""Verifier for the readout-correction task (Data Science, Data Querying).

Every expectation is derived here, independently of the reference program: the shipped corpus is
embedded below, and eight held-out corpora are synthesized at grade time by the embedded corpus
generator (six structurally shifted corpora and two that keep the shipped feeds but change governed
parameters). Every report is compared exactly after parsing its file format, with no tolerance.

All gated checks require the core reports (unit assignments, order valuation, metric configuration,
arm metrics, readout, sample ratio report and decisions) to be exact in /app/out for the shipped
corpus and in the program's rerun on every held-out corpus; each held-out check additionally
requires all twenty reports of its own rerun to be exact.

Negative checks hold when the cheat or the named wrong reading is present; an honest run leaves
them False.
"""
